  <section>
    <h2>Result</h2>
    <p class="c-lead">A thesis, models of three objects, a film, and first prize.</p>
    <p>
      Conactive is speculative design: hand-built models and drawings, not working products. The thesis names the next step itself,
      testing the objects with people through rapid prototypes and Wizard-of-Oz studies. An external jury awarded it
      first prize of the Konstanzer Designpreis in the summer semester of 2022.
    </p>
